  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Preheat the oven to 200°C/180°C fan-forced. Peel the **zucchini** into thin ribbons using a vegetable peeler.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/5a9f20beae08b506ea1d1ef2/step-73ad97de.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Place the **wholemeal pizza bases** on a flat surface, rough side down, and use the back of a spoon to spread evenly with the **pizza sauce**.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/5a9f20beae08b506ea1d1ef2/step-85bdb51f.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Top the pizza with the **zucchini** ribbons and dollops of **traditional pesto**. Crumble over the **fetta. **TIP**: Make sure to spread the ingredients evenly over the pizza base to prevent a soggy base!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/5a9f20beae08b506ea1d1ef2/step-16d63502.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Place the pizzas in the oven directly onto the wire racks and cook for **10 minutes**, or until the cheese is melted and the base is crispy. **TIP**: Placing the pizzas directly onto the wire racks helps the base to crisp up.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/5a9f20beae08b506ea1d1ef2/step-ff7e0c2d.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "While the pizza is baking, combine the **vinegar, honey** and **olive oil (1 tbs for 2 people / 1 tbs for 4 people)** in a medium bowl. Season with a **pinch** of **salt** and **pepper** and mix well. Add the **rocket leaves** and toss to coat. **TIP**: Add the rocket just before serving to avoid soggy leaves.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/5a9f20beae08b506ea1d1ef2/step-0302caa9.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Slice the speedy basil pesto pizza into wedges and top with half of the dressed rocket. Serve the remaining rocket on the side.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/5a9f20beae08b506ea1d1ef2/step-bbdf5472.jpg"
    }
  ]
